# Welcome {.unnumbered}

This is the book website for the **Data Analysis & Information Extraction** course at **CUNEF Universidad**. 

The book covers all course contents and provides full explanation of the different topics. You will find explanations and examples to guide your learning.

The book is structured following the course schedule. Now we explain the content of each chapter with references to each of the main units the course is structured. 

1. **Introduction to Programming** chapter covers the configuration and introduces R and RStudio software we will use for developing with R during the course. It introduces the different parts of the software and how to use it. (Unit 1)

2. **Programming with R** focuses on explaining all basic concepts of the R language, teaching the different data types, main functions and programming structures. To provide the student with the basic knowledge needed for following the next chapters. (Unit 1)

3. **Visualization** will teach you the different tools available on R for creating plots and use them accordingly for showing the insights of the data. (Unit 2)

4. **Manipulation** chapter will review the different available elements to manipulate the data and transform the information to analyze what we need. (Unit 2)

5. **Exploratory Data Analysis** will summarise all we have seen until this point and provide you a template guide on how to explore data and find useful insights. (Unit 2)

